WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.800
How can I tell whether a desire

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.280
is leading me wisely?

3
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.600
Romans twelve connects discerning God’s will

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.440
with the renewal of our minds.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.680
The world can teach us to measure

6
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.180
every choice by status or comfort.

7
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.100
Scripture helps us examine those assumptions

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.760
in light of what God has done

9
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:21.260
in Christ.

10
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.480
As you consider an opportunity,

11
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.900
ask what is shaping your judgment.

12
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.680
Are you seeking admiration?

13
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.820
Are you making room for love,

14
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:30.480
truth,

15
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:31.320
and service?

16
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:34.460
Renewal grows as you return to God’s

17
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.260
Word and let it correct your thinking.

18
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.580
His Spirit is at work in you.

19
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.160
God is patiently forming your judgment.

20
00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.740
You can keep learning to recognize what

21
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:44.400
pleases him.
